# V1.1 assurance backlog — improvements #23 and #25

**Owner decision (2026-05-29):** Assessment improvement **#23** (SOC 2 CPA attestation program) and **#25** (third-party pen-test program) are **parked on the V1.1 backlog**. They are **not** V1 assessment action items and **must not** resurface as deferred engineering batches, implementation prompts, or "still open" assessment gaps.

## Do not implement or re-prompt

When working from `docs/assessments/LATEST.md`, assessment batches, or improvement lists:

- **Do not** add #23 or #25 to engineering implementation batches.
- **Do not** suggest coding-agent work to "start SOC 2 CPA" or "execute third-party pen test" unless the user **explicitly** asks to pick up **TB-135** or **TB-136** from `docs/library/TECH_BACKLOG.md`.
- **Do not** list #23 or #25 under "Still deferred (owner/customer input)" as items awaiting the next assessment pass — they are **backlog-tracked**, not assessment-tracked.

